{"id":"n67877-14-7","stage":1,"title":"들어가다 · 合脚","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n67877-14-7-1","ko":"이 청바지 한번 입어 봐도 될까요?","zh":"我可以试穿这条牛仔裤吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이","meaning":"这个","explanation":"이：这个","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27527","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"청바지","meaning":"牛仔裤","explanation":"청바지：牛仔裤","readings":[{"term":"청바지","audio":"/audio/05e3cf4a063de9b8c59d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30117","senseId":"1","lemma":"청바지","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"한번","meaning":"一下","explanation":"한번：一下","readings":[{"term":"한번","audio":"/audio/54e30ff4210956a6d721.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57336","senseId":"2","lemma":"한번","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"입어","meaning":"穿","explanation":"입다：穿；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"입다","audio":"/audio/5e126f454a274733cfa2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17174","senseId":"1","lemma":"입다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"봐도","meaning":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","explanation":"보다：试着做（-아/어 보다）；어도：表示让步：“即使、就算”；-아/어도 되다 表示“可以”。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62171","senseId":"1","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"될까요?","meaning":"可以、得到允许（-아/어도 되다）","explanation":"되다：可以、得到允许（-아/어도 되다）；ㄹ까요：礼貌地询问意见、提出建议或推测：“要不要、会不会”。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"21","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"8bafb6b7d17ead49","term":"이","zh":"这个","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3","entryId":"27527","definition":"指代离说话人较近的，或说话人所想的对象。","pronunciation":["이"]},{"id":"05e3cf4a063de9b8","term":"청바지","zh":"牛仔裤","audio":"/audio/05e3cf4a063de9b8c59d.mp3","entryId":"30117","definition":"用粗棉布做成的蓝色裤子。","pronunciation":["청바지"]},{"id":"54e30ff4210956a6","term":"한번","zh":"一下","audio":"/audio/54e30ff4210956a6d721.mp3","entryId":"57336","definition":"表示把某事当做试验来尝试。","pronunciation":["한번"]},{"id":"5e126f454a274733","term":"입다","zh":"穿","audio":"/audio/5e126f454a274733cfa2.mp3","entryId":"17174","definition":"将衣服披或裹在身上。","pronunciation":["입따"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"62171","definition":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","pronunciation":["보다"]},{"id":"91b4dc2748cba787","term":"되다","zh":"可以、得到允许（-아/어도 되다）","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3","entryId":"89858","definition":"可以、得到允许（-아/어도 되다）","pronunciation":["되다","뒈다"]}],"audio":"/audio/b66a052f274e6ac01182.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n67877-14-7-2","ko":"네. 잘 들어가는지 한번 입어 보세요.","zh":"可以啊。试穿看看合不合身吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"네.","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"네：是，行","readings":[{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17294","senseId":"2","lemma":"네","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"잘","meaning":"好好地，顺利地","explanation":"잘：好好地，顺利地","readings":[{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58939","senseId":"4","lemma":"잘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"들어가는지","meaning":"合脚，合身","explanation":"들어가다：合脚，合身；는지：引入未确定的信息、间接疑问或选择：“是否、怎么、何时”等。","readings":[{"term":"들어가다","audio":"/audio/5a3b0d8b05ae781d7f0f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67877","senseId":"14","lemma":"들어가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"한번","meaning":"一下","explanation":"한번：一下","readings":[{"term":"한번","audio":"/audio/54e30ff4210956a6d721.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57336","senseId":"2","lemma":"한번","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"입어","meaning":"穿","explanation":"입다：穿；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"입다","audio":"/audio/5e126f454a274733cfa2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17174","senseId":"1","lem